This product implements published algorithms. Credit where due:

  Median-cut colour quantization
    Heckbert, P. (1982). "Color Image Quantization for Frame Buffer
    Display." ACM SIGGRAPH Computer Graphics, 16(3), 297-307.

  Iterative palette refinement (k-means / Lloyd relaxation)
    Lloyd, S. P. (1982). "Least squares quantization in PCM."
    IEEE Transactions on Information Theory, 28(2), 129-137.

  Floyd-Steinberg error diffusion
    Floyd, R. W., & Steinberg, L. (1976). "An adaptive algorithm for
    spatial greyscale." Proceedings of the SID, 17(2), 75-77.

  Jarvis-Judice-Ninke error diffusion
    Jarvis, J. F., Judice, C. N., & Ninke, W. H. (1976). "A survey of
    techniques for the display of continuous tone pictures on bilevel
    displays." Computer Graphics and Image Processing, 5(1), 13-40.

  Low-cost perceptual colour distance ("redmean")
    Riemersma, T. / CompuPhase. "Colour metric."
    https://www.compuphase.com/cmetric.htm

  PNG container format
    Boutell, T. et al. RFC 2083, "PNG (Portable Network Graphics)
    Specification Version 1.0."

No source code was taken from pngquant or libimagequant. Pngine is an
independent implementation, written to be usable under a permissive
licence on Android without native code.
